WEBVTT

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.466
This place...

00:02:21.866 --> 00:02:25.066
It seems there's
something here after all.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:40.100
GILLIAM RETURNS

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.700
Do you really intend to go, Gilliam?

00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:03.666
The unit has been disbanded

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.900
and General Logi has been
relegated to the country.

00:03:06.433 --> 00:03:08.133
If it's to be done, it has to be now.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.430
You narrowly escaped death...

00:03:12.033 --> 00:03:13.303
I didn't.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.700
I died then.

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.570
I lost everything that day.

00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:26.926
So I have to get it all back.

00:03:27.466 --> 00:03:28.566
With those wounds?

00:03:29.766 --> 00:03:30.766
This is nothing!

00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:39.096
I don't feel a thing.

00:03:39.233 --> 00:03:41.033
So your mind is made up, then.

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:42.433
Absolutely.

00:03:42.866 --> 00:03:48.896
I can't forgive those Shadow Wielders,
especially that woman.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.300
Beat it. This isn't a place for spies.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:54.833
You can't do it alone.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.730
You'd just be in the way.

00:03:58.266 --> 00:03:59.526
I don't mean me.

00:04:00.533 --> 00:04:02.633
These guys are the ones
who will go with you.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.570
What's this?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.900
A new model.

00:04:16.366 --> 00:04:21.166
I had to go through quite a lot to get them.
So take them with you.

00:04:21.533 --> 00:04:24.533
You should know that
I don't trust machines!

00:04:24.566 --> 00:04:26.366
They aren't just any machines.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.830
They're works of art.

00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:37.296
I'm telling you!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.530
My home is that way!

00:04:40.766 --> 00:04:44.166
Stop griping at me!
I'm trying to fly this thing.

00:04:44.633 --> 00:04:48.203
You're just gonna head
for your ruins, aren't you?!

00:04:48.266 --> 00:04:49.696
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:04:50.066 --> 00:04:52.266
My ruins are closer.

00:04:52.366 --> 00:04:53.996
I'm too scared to go near them.

00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:56.726
Do they wanna get stronger
that badly, maro?

00:04:56.966 --> 00:04:58.926
There's no point in
getting impatient, maro.

00:04:59.266 --> 00:05:02.826
Have you already forgotten
about your rampage the other day?

00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:06.873
There are four texts left.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.500
Chapter Three that
Marumaro misinterpreted...

00:05:10.566 --> 00:05:13.326
Chapter Four about
a snowy field and ice...

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.500
Chapter Five about regeneration...

00:05:17.533 --> 00:05:21.803
And lastly, Chapter Seven
with this list of numbers...

00:05:22.866 --> 00:05:29.196
Four texts left. Each one holds
a key for us to unlock new power.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:33.600
But even if we could decipher them all,
a mystery still remains.

00:05:34.866 --> 00:05:38.166
There is no explanation
from Zola about it.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.400
Well, the time will eventually come
when we'll have to face that.

00:05:44.433 --> 00:05:46.403
I'm telling you!

00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:48.473
My ruins are next!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.970
Why don't you go alone?

00:05:50.166 --> 00:05:52.896
I don't like that tone! You areâ€”

00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:56.996
Look, maro! It's a rainbow, maro!

00:06:06.166 --> 00:06:08.096
Wow, it's beautiful.

00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:13.703
You two, stop arguing with such scary looks
and calm down by looking at that, maro.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.300
Fighting's no good, maro.

00:06:16.933 --> 00:06:19.533
Right. Fighting's no good.

00:06:19.566 --> 00:06:21.696
I'm next no matter what anyone says!

00:06:21.733 --> 00:06:23.673
Don't just decide it yourself!

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.000
You're place is just way too far!

00:06:26.033 --> 00:06:29.573
That's not fair!
We went to your ruins already!

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.470
And you got that pendant!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.800
That has nothing to do with this!

00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:38.273
I see. Could it be that you're upset
because Shu and I got engaged?

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:38.970
What?!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.970
Or are you jealous because
I've got a great body?

00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:45.726
You just got all the nutrients
concentrated in one spot!

00:06:46.233 --> 00:06:49.073
What?! Don't be acting all big
just because you can fly this thing!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:53.470
Oh? Then what purpose
do you serve around here?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.470
What...

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.630
What gives you the right
to say something like that to me?!

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:07.173
What do you know about me?!

00:07:07.533 --> 00:07:09.503
W-What's the deal all of a sudden?!

00:07:10.166 --> 00:07:13.926
What do you know...about...

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.300
That's enough!

00:07:17.933 --> 00:07:18.603
Zola...

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:22.570
Regardless of where we go next,
there's something we need to do first.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.200
Something we need to do?

00:07:25.933 --> 00:07:26.603
Huh?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.630
The power upload to
the drilling beam is complete.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.400
400 until the destination.

00:07:40.666 --> 00:07:43.496
All section, stand by
in battle formation two!

00:07:45.066 --> 00:07:48.326
I can just imagine
your chagrined face, Zola.

00:07:48.366 --> 00:07:50.066
Zola, Zola!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.170
Hey, what's going on?

00:07:55.766 --> 00:07:57.766
A damaged Mechat is coming.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.330
What unit are they with?

00:08:00.933 --> 00:08:02.333
Prepare to extinguish fire!

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.430
- Yes, sir!
- H-Hey!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:08.700
What?!

00:08:08.733 --> 00:08:09.733
For real?!

00:08:26.033 --> 00:08:27.903
Marumaro and I will
defend against the enemy!

00:08:28.166 --> 00:08:29.796
Shu and Jiro will take care
of the warehouse!

00:08:29.833 --> 00:08:31.633
Kluke, get the ship fueled up fast!

00:08:32.133 --> 00:08:34.973
We don't have much time!
Let's finish this in five minutes!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.200
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:08:50.533 --> 00:08:51.633
Miss Zola.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:22.030
Whoops, that's enough!
I'm not a soldier.

00:09:22.566 --> 00:09:23.726
Then who are you?

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.670
I am carrying on the will of Homeron,
the master informant.

00:09:30.166 --> 00:09:31.166
Homeron's?

00:09:35.566 --> 00:09:36.696
What am I?

00:09:40.466 --> 00:09:43.626
What's that Delphinium thinking?!

00:09:44.333 --> 00:09:46.833
Why take the risk of
getting me these new models

00:09:46.866 --> 00:09:49.566
and providing me
with their coordinates?

00:09:50.533 --> 00:09:54.303
Oh well.
I guess I'll just go along for the ride.

00:09:54.766 --> 00:09:56.196
Can you hear me, Gilliam?

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.270
What is it?

00:09:57.733 --> 00:10:02.203
I heard the 48th Strategic Refueling Base
was attacked by Shadow Wielders.

00:10:02.633 --> 00:10:03.633
Roger.

00:10:10.566 --> 00:10:14.426
What?! Why do we have to
go to Bouquet's ruins first?!

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.600
Things have changed.
You'll follow my order.

00:10:18.133 --> 00:10:19.403
I'm not satisfied with that!

00:10:19.666 --> 00:10:22.626
She's kind of harsh today, maro.

00:10:22.833 --> 00:10:23.833
Yeah...

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:26.500
There's only one way to
handle a situation like this...

00:10:27.333 --> 00:10:29.703
Let sleeping dogs lie.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:32.970
We got some information
from Homeron's subordinate

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.070
during our last raid.

00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:35.466
Homeron's?

00:10:35.833 --> 00:10:38.603
Nene's Flying Fortress changed course.

00:10:39.133 --> 00:10:40.873
How is it related to this?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.530
The course goes right over
Bouquet's ruins.

00:10:44.966 --> 00:10:45.626
What?!

00:10:47.233 --> 00:10:50.573
It's Nene. I have no doubt that
he's planning something.

00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:55.373
We're going to rush over to
Bouquet's ruins before it's too late.

00:10:55.966 --> 00:10:56.626
Okay?

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.070
Okay.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.270
It's an enemy attack!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:19.870
Where's the enemy?!

00:11:20.166 --> 00:11:21.666
They're close! Stay alert!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.700
They're different from the usual ones.

00:11:30.733 --> 00:11:31.833
It's a new model, huh?

00:11:32.166 --> 00:11:33.866
We meet again, woman.

00:11:38.466 --> 00:11:39.466
You...

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.370
You're a persistent one.

00:11:45.566 --> 00:11:47.996
I've come back from
the depths of hell...

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:51.903
to get back everything
that was taken from me!

00:11:52.833 --> 00:11:54.333
That's some unjustified resentment.

00:11:54.833 --> 00:11:57.403
I will have my revenge for my comrades!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.400
I will have my revenge for my comrades!

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.000
Everyone, spread out! Take them down!

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:17.870
Right!

00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:18.803
Kluke!

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.900
Back everyone up!

00:12:20.533 --> 00:12:21.733
And I leave Bouquet to you!

00:12:22.033 --> 00:12:22.703
Huh?

00:12:22.966 --> 00:12:23.626
Okay.

00:12:44.933 --> 00:12:46.173
This thing...

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.200
They're fast!

00:12:51.666 --> 00:12:53.496
They're not just fast, maro!

00:13:02.533 --> 00:13:04.533
They pack more of a punch, too!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.300
She was right. They are works of art.

00:13:12.933 --> 00:13:18.103
Now I can take you on
without any reserve, woman!

00:13:37.333 --> 00:13:38.003
Hey!

00:13:38.033 --> 00:13:39.103
Bouquet!

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.370
Let go of me!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.000
What're you trying to do?!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.730
I'm going to fight, too!

00:13:46.133 --> 00:13:48.603
Don't be absurd! You're...

00:13:49.666 --> 00:13:50.796
If I don't fight now...

00:13:52.133 --> 00:13:53.773
If I'm not of use now,

00:13:54.666 --> 00:13:58.466
then I'll never know
what my purpose is here!

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.030
It was always like this.

00:14:04.266 --> 00:14:07.026
Since I was young,

00:14:08.233 --> 00:14:09.403
I was always slow and a klutz.

00:14:09.666 --> 00:14:11.466
I always had lousy athletic ability.

00:14:12.533 --> 00:14:14.473
I would always get in everyone's way.

00:14:17.133 --> 00:14:19.173
SINCE THE MOMENT I SAW YOU...
The first person I fell in love with...

00:14:22.233 --> 00:14:24.273
FROM LONG TIME AGO, I...
And then the next one...

00:14:26.766 --> 00:14:28.996
YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE FOR ME!
And the person after that...

00:14:34.566 --> 00:14:36.826
They all said the same thing in the end.

00:14:37.866 --> 00:14:40.926
That they couldn't go out with
someone useless like me.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.770
That's why I want to be useful!

00:14:58.400 --> 00:14:59.400
We're the same, huh?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.030
I was also in a fluster...

00:15:04.933 --> 00:15:07.233
Ever since the beginning
of this journey...

00:15:07.533 --> 00:15:14.233
I had no power so everyone had
to protect me during a battle...

00:15:20.166 --> 00:15:25.296
Even after I got Phoenix, I still thought
that I was only getting in the way.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:28.800
And even now...

00:15:31.866 --> 00:15:32.866
What?!

00:15:49.733 --> 00:15:51.603
What is driving him so much?!

00:15:53.966 --> 00:15:54.996
Kluke...

00:15:55.866 --> 00:15:59.826
I'm sorry.
I judged you by your appearance.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:05.170
I just thought you were being selfish.
I'm really sorry!

00:16:06.433 --> 00:16:09.133
It's okay. Half of that is true.

00:16:11.266 --> 00:16:12.796
We are the same.

00:16:18.233 --> 00:16:19.233
Bouquet...

00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:28.703
Let's make up. Shu said so too.
That fighting's no good.

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:32.600
What is it?

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.200
At that moment...

00:16:34.466 --> 00:16:35.126
Huh?

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.770
There was something...

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:41.200
Right. Fighting's no good.

00:16:41.433 --> 00:16:42.433
Fighting...

00:16:44.333 --> 00:16:45.633
That's right! The rainbow!

00:16:45.933 --> 00:16:46.603
Rainbow?

00:16:46.933 --> 00:16:50.103
Please, transform into
Chapter Seven of the Extra Seven!

00:16:50.466 --> 00:16:52.826
Sure, but what is it?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.330
Just do it, quickly!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.700
Kluke?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.000
Well, just watch.

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:03.730
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!
Turn into Chapter Seven of the Extra Seven!

00:17:06.433 --> 00:17:07.903
Kluke, could it be?

00:17:08.233 --> 00:17:10.433
The key is to see past appearances...

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.200
What does that mean?

00:17:12.666 --> 00:17:14.726
Something just felt out of place.

00:17:15.133 --> 00:17:18.133
The numbers in this list
aren't actually numbers!

00:17:18.633 --> 00:17:19.303
Huh?!

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.700
We thought there was
a formula for the numbers.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:25.830
We thought the letters were for the text.
These were preconceived notions!

00:17:26.366 --> 00:17:27.466
What do you mean?

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.600
The second key is the rainbow.

00:17:29.866 --> 00:17:30.526
Rainbow?

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:36.870
Rainbows are made by drops of water
after a rainfall reflecting light.

00:17:37.133 --> 00:17:40.433
What does the rainbow have
to do with this sequence?

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:41.670
This.

00:17:43.033 --> 00:17:44.033
That's...

00:17:44.133 --> 00:17:45.673
The crystal from that time.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.470
We were sure that it had
some kind of purpose, remember?

00:17:58.866 --> 00:18:01.426
If we look at these numbers through this...

00:18:02.766 --> 00:18:05.666
I knew it!
The numbers look like letters.

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.130
In the depths of affection...

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.430
You can read ancient letters?!

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.230
A little bit. I learned from Zola.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.200
There's no doubt.

00:18:15.433 --> 00:18:16.903
This is my text!

00:18:17.666 --> 00:18:18.866
Kluke...

00:18:19.466 --> 00:18:20.596
Thank you, Bouquet.

00:18:21.266 --> 00:18:22.496
It's all thanks to you.

00:18:29.033 --> 00:18:30.033
Did we do it?!

00:18:34.833 --> 00:18:36.003
It's getting up again, huh?

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.200
Quite pesky, maro.

00:18:38.433 --> 00:18:39.773
What a pain!

00:18:39.933 --> 00:18:41.303
I'll take care of them now!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.170
Wait!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.430
Something's wrong!

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.470
W-What?

00:18:53.033 --> 00:18:53.703
What's that?!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.030
Where are you looking?!

00:19:03.533 --> 00:19:06.433
Hey, this looks bad.

00:19:07.033 --> 00:19:08.603
Leave this one to me!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:09.670
What?!

00:19:17.633 --> 00:19:19.273
Power filled with affection.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:24.600
Remove the crystal hidden in
the heart and place it in its birthplace.

00:19:25.166 --> 00:19:28.926
The gentle power will sleep eternally.

00:19:29.766 --> 00:19:32.396
It's the text from
Chapter Seven of the Extra Seven!

00:19:32.933 --> 00:19:35.033
But that's the one with the numbers!

00:19:35.333 --> 00:19:38.273
Kluke and I solved the puzzle!

00:19:38.566 --> 00:19:39.226
What?!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.130
Phoenix!

00:20:17.166 --> 00:20:17.826
What?!

00:20:21.466 --> 00:20:22.796
Where are you looking?!

00:20:23.133 --> 00:20:24.633
Don't underestimate me, woman!

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:26.970
Ray Stinger!

00:20:34.966 --> 00:20:38.066
This is how I settle things!

00:20:39.966 --> 00:20:40.966
What?!

00:20:56.033 --> 00:20:57.033
Did that do it?!

00:20:59.166 --> 00:21:00.626
This game's over!

00:21:02.533 --> 00:21:05.303
Hornet Assassin!

00:21:17.133 --> 00:21:19.603
Todd... Bishop...

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.500
I'm sorry.

00:21:32.733 --> 00:21:35.933
Didn't I tell you that you
couldn't do it alone?

00:21:36.833 --> 00:21:41.903
No hard feelings.
Your death is for his sake.

00:22:03.833 --> 00:22:05.673
Can't we go any faster?

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.430
This is as fast as it'll go!

00:22:07.766 --> 00:22:10.666
We're almost there.
As soon as we go over that mountain.

00:22:18.366 --> 00:22:19.866
That's Nene's fortress!

00:22:26.433 --> 00:22:28.273
My ruins!

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:34.200
The whole thing...

00:22:34.666 --> 00:22:35.826
After them, Kluke!

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:36.670
Roger!

00:24:18.033 --> 00:24:22.003
Alone inside her ruins stolen by Nene,
Bouquet strives to unlock her power.

00:24:22.033 --> 00:24:24.703
Powering up is like shedding
a layer of skin, isn't it?

00:24:24.733 --> 00:24:26.073
Time to shed, Hippo!

00:24:26.100 --> 00:24:29.200
Oh no! Are you trying to make it
impossible for me to be a pure bride?

00:24:29.233 --> 00:24:30.773
You're a boy, Hippo!

00:24:30.800 --> 00:24:34.400
Now, change into something
cool and powerful, quickly!

00:24:34.566 --> 00:24:36.696
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Shining Hippo
